    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical for everyday tasks like budgeting and cooking, but I’m not a math genius. My vocational diploma taught me basics, and I appreciate its logic—though I prefer physics and history. I don’t stress over it because I see it as useful, not intimidating.",
